- ✅ `GeneratedRegex` used for 3 core patterns (L13-24) — correct for .NET 7+
- ✅ `IsAllUpperCase` uses `foreach` loop instead of LINQ `.All()` — zero allocation
- ✅ `IsAsciiAlphanumeric` / `WordCount` use `foreach` over string — zero allocation
- ✅ `Slugify` uses `ToLowerInvariant()` — correct culture handling

